<%@ Page Title="Preventive plans" Language="C#" MasterPageFile="~/Admin/Admin.Master" AutoEventWireup="true" CodeBehind="Plans.aspx.cs" Inherits="ForteMove.Web.Admin.Maintenance.PlansPage" %>
<asp:Content ID="BodyContent" ContentPlaceHolderID="MainContent" runat="server">
<header class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Maintenance</p><h1>Preventive plans</h1></div><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="Overview.aspx">Maintenance overview</a></header>
<asp:Panel ID="pnlMessage" runat="server" Visible="false" CssClass="alert alert-danger" role="alert"><asp:Literal ID="litMessage" runat="server" /></asp:Panel>
<section class="surface-card"><asp:Literal ID="litPlans" runat="server" /></section><section class="surface-card"><h2><asp:Literal ID="litEditor" runat="server" /></h2><p>Use verified service evidence or enter approved first-due thresholds. A first due threshold is not a recorded service.</p><div class="maintenance-form-grid"><div class="form-group"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="ddlBus" Text="Bus" /><asp:DropDownList ID="ddlBus" runat="server" CssClass="form-control"  /></div><div class="form-group"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="txtName" Text="Service name" /><asp:TextBox ID="txtName" runat="server" CssClass="form-control" MaxLength="150" /></div><div class="form-group"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="txtDays" Text="Interval days (optional)" /><asp:TextBox ID="txtDays" runat="server" CssClass="form-control" TextMode="Number" /></div><div class="form-group"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="txtKm" Text="Interval kilometres (optional)" /><asp:TextBox ID="txtKm" runat="server" CssClass="form-control" MaxLength="15" /></div></div><asp:CheckBox ID="chkVerified" runat="server" Text=" Use verified previous service" /><div class="maintenance-form-grid"><div class="form-group"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="txtLastDate" Text="Verified last service date" /><asp:TextBox ID="txtLastDate" runat="server" CssClass="form-control" TextMode="Date" /></div><div class="form-group"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="txtLastOdo" Text="Verified last service odometer (km)" /><asp:TextBox ID="txtLastOdo" runat="server" CssClass="form-control"  /></div><div class="form-group"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="txtNextDate" Text="Explicit first due date" /><asp:TextBox ID="txtNextDate" runat="server" CssClass="form-control" TextMode="Date" /></div><div class="form-group"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="txtNextOdo" Text="Explicit first due odometer (km)" /><asp:TextBox ID="txtNextOdo" runat="server" CssClass="form-control"  /></div></div><p>After a recorded work order completion, the service baseline is preserved. Changing intervals recalculates thresholds from that completion.</p><asp:CheckBox ID="chkBlocking" runat="server" Text=" Block new operations when overdue" /><asp:CheckBox ID="chkActive" runat="server" Text=" Active plan" Checked="true" /><div class="maintenance-actions"><asp:Button ID="btnSave" runat="server" Text="Save plan" CssClass="btn btn-primary" OnClick="Save_Click" /><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="Plans.aspx">New plan</a></div></section>
</asp:Content>

